@startuml trei-c4-component
title TREI (trei-service) — C4 Component (hexagonal, Java)

package "api" {
  [SessaoController]
  [PropostaController]
  [NoController]
  [AprovacaoController]
  [HealthController]
}

package "application" {
  [ConduzirSessaoTreinamento]
  [RegistrarPropostaLlm]
  [MaterializarProposta]
  [AprovarNoCuidadora]
  [AprovarNoPaciente]
  [PublicarNo]
  [DrenarOutbox]
}

package "domain" {
  [NoArvoreFala <<aggregate>>]
  [ConteudoLocale <<vo>>]
  [SessaoTreinamento]
  [PropostaLlm]
  [PublicacaoOutbox]
  interface LlmAuthoringPort
  interface EmbeddingPort
  interface TtsSynthesisPort
  interface AudioStorePort
  interface IndexPort
  interface AcsSessionPort
  interface PacPatientPort
  interface HistAuditPort
}

package "infrastructure" {
  [AnthropicClient]
  [EmbeddingSidecarClient]
  [ElevenLabsClient]
  [FilesystemAudioAdapter]
  [ElasticIndexAdapter]
  [AcsResourceServerConfig]
  [PacFeignClient]
  [HistFeignClient]
  [JpaRepositories]
  [OutboxScheduler]
}

' api -> application
SessaoController --> ConduzirSessaoTreinamento
PropostaController --> RegistrarPropostaLlm
NoController --> MaterializarProposta
AprovacaoController --> AprovarNoCuidadora
AprovacaoController --> AprovarNoPaciente

' application -> domain (gate + pipeline)
AprovarNoPaciente --> NoArvoreFala : evaluate gate
PublicarNo --> PublicacaoOutbox
DrenarOutbox --> PublicarNo

' ports implemented by infrastructure
RegistrarPropostaLlm ..> LlmAuthoringPort
PublicarNo ..> EmbeddingPort
PublicarNo ..> TtsSynthesisPort
PublicarNo ..> AudioStorePort
PublicarNo ..> IndexPort
AprovarNoPaciente ..> AcsSessionPort
ConduzirSessaoTreinamento ..> PacPatientPort
PublicarNo ..> HistAuditPort

LlmAuthoringPort <|.. AnthropicClient
EmbeddingPort <|.. EmbeddingSidecarClient
TtsSynthesisPort <|.. ElevenLabsClient
AudioStorePort <|.. FilesystemAudioAdapter
IndexPort <|.. ElasticIndexAdapter
AcsSessionPort <|.. AcsResourceServerConfig
PacPatientPort <|.. PacFeignClient
HistAuditPort <|.. HistFeignClient

note bottom of domain
  Dependency rule (shared hexagonal ADR
  ADR-001-hexagonal-architecture.md):
  domain imports nothing outward;
  application depends on domain;
  api + infrastructure depend inward.
  G5 model id recorded on ConteudoLocale
  at embed time (SPEC-11).
end note
@enduml
